From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Velkov <iav@iav.lv>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:36:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] compiler-gcc.h: use compiler-gcc4.h for GCC 5 and newer

GCC 5 and newer have no linux/compiler-gccN.h of their own here, so
generating include/autoconf.mk with a current cross compiler fails.
The GCC 4 header covers what this tree needs.

Signed-off-by: Igor Velkov <iav@iav.lv>
---
 include/linux/compiler-gcc.h | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/linux/compiler-gcc.h b/include/linux/compiler-gcc.h
index e057bd2..0f93da3 100644
--- a/include/linux/compiler-gcc.h
+++ b/include/linux/compiler-gcc.h
@@ -111,7 +111,11 @@
 #define __gcc_header(x) #x
 #define _gcc_header(x) __gcc_header(linux/compiler-gcc##x.h)
 #define gcc_header(x) _gcc_header(x)
+#if __GNUC__ > 4
+#include <linux/compiler-gcc4.h>
+#else
 #include gcc_header(__GNUC__)
+#endif
 
 #if !defined(__noclone)
 #define __noclone	/* not needed */
